@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{socialLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

# 시드 user 101로 로그인. 본인 글은 신고할 수 없다.
# reason: SPAM ABUSE HARASSMENT SEXUAL VIOLENCE HATE IMPERSONATION PRIVACY OTHER

### 0. 소셜 로그인 (시드 user 101)
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-myultary-test-001",
  "email": "myultary.test@example.com",
  "name": "한호"
}

### 1. 유저 신고
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "USER",
  "targetId": 102,
  "reason": "HARASSMENT"
}

### 2. 게시글 신고
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "FEED",
  "targetId": 107,
  "reason": "SPAM"
}

### 3. 댓글 신고
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "COMMENT",
  "targetId": 202,
  "reason": "ABUSE"
}

### 4. 답글 신고
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "REPLY",
  "targetId": 201,
  "reason": "ABUSE"
}

### 5. 신고 취소 (신고요청만. reportId는 접수 응답)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
